      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📧 AUTOMATED INITIAL COLD OUTREACH EMAILS WITH SAFETY CONTROLS\n\n## HOW?\n\nThis workflow automatically sends personalized emails to contacts\nstored in Google Sheets and NocoDB.\n\nIt includes email validation, spam filtering, daily send limits,\nhuman-like delays, and automatic status updates.\n\n## SETUP STEPS\n1. Connect Google Sheets\n2. Connect Gmail\n3. Connect NocoDB (optional)\n4. Review email limits before activating\n",
