      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 4: Initial Email Status Check\n\nThis step checks if an initial email was already sent.\n\n-->If yes, the workflow skips the contact to avoid duplicate or accidental re-sending.\n\n\n\n",
        "height": 656,
