      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 6: Daily Status Check\n\nThis step controls how many emails can be sent per day.\n\nIt:\n• Blocks sending on weekends\n• Enforces daily email limits\n• Tracks counts per email type\n\n\n\n\n",
